(Chapter 3: Installation) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Connect the power adapter to the DC-IN port on the rear panel.) Tj T*
(2. Attach the antennas to the SMA connectors and tighten by hand.) Tj T*
(3. Connect the WAN port to your modem using the supplied Ethernet cable.) Tj T*
(4. Press and hold the power button for two seconds until the status LED turns green.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
